            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Add a Sonnet context window setting (200K/1M) in Settings for plans without extended context</li>
<li>Store credentials as a local file instead of macOS Keychain, fixing the password prompt after every app update</li>
<li>Migrate existing Keychain credentials on first launch and delete the old entry</li>
<li>Hide sessions whose project directory no longer exists (e.g. after removing a git worktree)</li>
<li>Rename the project from CCInfo to ccInfo to match the repo and DMG naming</li>
</ul>

]]></description>
